  "desc": "Third video of the night, for the Iowa lead explosion, and this one is the most important video for those living in the area. This is a list of things you can do, and things not to do, to protect yourself if you end up in the area of the plumes. I'm talking about animal care, livestock, HVAC systems, purifiers, etc. More will come soon about this, but not till we have a map so people don't buy up all those supplies. U.S. Army — Soil Sampling Form: https://d34w7g4gy10iej.cloudfront.net/pubs/pdf_78374.pdf University of Iowa — Soil Monitoring Signup: https://lead-sampling-signup.iowa-insight.workers.dev/ #Iowa #lead #army #safetytips #science",
